    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d321">

                <pb facs="0587" n="501" xml:id="pg501"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister Churchill to President Roosevelt
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d321-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-12-21">December 21, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>From the Former Naval Person to the
                    President. Personal and Most Secret. Number 238.</p>
                <p>Yes, certainly; the sooner the better. I am greatly relieved. It is the only
                    thing to do. All arrangements here will be made on basis that it is a staff
                    meeting only.</p>
                <p>Suggested code name “<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Symbol</hi>”.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d321-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d321-f1-content">
                <p>Transmitted via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
